#. Description of the plugin
#: verification-expiry-for-hivepress.php
msgid "Give a vendor's verified status an expiry date, per vendor or site-wide, so vendors must keep their profile up to date to stay verified."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: the period chosen under HivePress, Settings, Verification Expiry, e.g. "3 months".
