msgid "Verification Period"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:310
msgid "How long this listing's verification lasts. The date below is filled in from this each time the listing is verified, and again whenever this choice changes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:318
#: includes/components/class-hpve-verification.php:433
msgid "Verified Until"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:319
msgid "The day after this date the listing's verified badge is removed and its owner is emailed. Pick a date of your own, or leave it to be filled in from the period above. Blank means it does not expire."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:345
msgid "Verified Listings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:346
msgid "HivePress also has a Verified box on each listing, separate from the vendor's. While \"Badges to Expire\" above is \"Vendor badge only\", each listing's verification gets its own period and date, shown under the Verified box on the listing's edit screen, and the listing's owner is emailed when it is verified, before the date and when the badge is removed. The reminder goes out the number of days before expiry set above. In sync mode listing badges follow the vendor, so these settings are not used."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:351
msgid "Default Listing Verification Period"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:352
msgid "How long a listing's verification lasts unless its own edit screen says otherwise. \"Does not expire\" keeps the current HivePress behaviour, where a verified listing stays verified until you untick the box. Changing this does not move dates already set; select listings on the Listings screen and use the \"Apply verification period\" bulk action for that."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:359
msgid "Listing Expiry Email"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:360
msgid "Email the listing's owner when its verified badge is removed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:361
msgid "The email asks them to check the listing and their contact details and to get in touch to have it verified again. Untick to remove the badge silently."
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:368
msgid "Listing Verified Email"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:369
msgid "Email the listing's owner when it is marked as verified"
msgstr ""

#: includes/components/class-hpve-listing-verification.php:370
msgid "Tells them the badge now shows on the listing and, when its verification has a date, when it is due for review. Not sent for the bulk action or when only the period changes."
msgstr ""

